  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the lines $\\mathrm{x}(3 \\lambda+1)+\\mathrm{y}(7 \\lambda+2)=17 \\lambda+5$, $\\lambda$ being a parameter, all passing through a point P . One of these lines (say L) is farthest from the origin. If the distance of $L$ from the point $(3,6)$ is $d$, then the value of $d^2$ is"
  },
